, adhesion promoters, revivers, pull up oils and crazy finishes, rectification oils and resins, water repelling agent, coloring dyes, repairers\u0096pigments, detergents and cleaners, and special products. Haryana Leather Chemicals Limited was incorporated in 1985 and is based in Gurugram, India."}}